Everything described below happened in online multiplayer, with a friend in my house and another one with good ping, all in half an hour of gameplay:
- Game lagged and became unplayable for the whole party during during volleyball game in party mode, and again during the next stage, we all had to quit;
- Black screens coming and going for players;
- Players got disconnected at random;
- Leaderboards not showing properly: Every endgame screen shows only my character and just the name of the others. Same for them.
- Clothes you unlock not appearing for selection.
Also, other things I'd like to see changed:
- You should be able to customize your char and not get a random build every time (specially if you always play with the same friends, it can be confusing to randomly change).
- Lack of menu controls for audio (no volume control for music and announcer, only mute, and nothing at all to game sounds)
